{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/007",
  "family": "FRE34"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u00496",
   "en": "Thank you. Thank you for saving me from those things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00497",
   "en": "Commander. That's him. That's Dr. Saleon.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00498",
   "en": "What? My name is Heart. Dr. Heart. Please, get me out of here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00499",
   "en": "Positive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00500",
   "en": "There's no escape this time, Doctor. I'd harvest your organs first, but we don't have the time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00501",
   "en": "You're crazy. He's crazy. Please, don't let him do this to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00502",
   "en": "Gladly.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_UNC52_05_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00503",
   "en": "Your days of butchering are over, Doctor.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00504",
   "en": "No. Please... Please!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00505",
   "en": "But... we have him. We can't let him get away. Not again?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00506",
   "en": "I've-- Okay. You're right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00507",
   "en": "You're a very lucky salarian. You owe the commander your life.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00508",
   "en": "Oh. Thank you so very much!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00509",
   "en": "You're all crazy!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00510",
   "en": "And so he dies anyway. What was the point of that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00511",
   "en": "Yeah. I don't think I've ever met anyone like you, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00512",
   "en": "Are you sure it's him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00513",
   "en": "Put him out of his misery so we can get going.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00514",
   "en": "We'll take him in. Drop him off with the military.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00515",
   "en": "If he dies, we'll never know what he's been up to, or how he did it. We'll take him in, interrogate him, and he'll serve his time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00516",
   "en": "This is my kill, Garrus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00517",
   "en": "You can't predict how people will act, Garrus. But you can control how you'll respond. In the end, that's what really matters.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00518",
   "en": "You certain?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00519",
   "en": "Garrus?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA60_05A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00520",
   "en": "Finish him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00521",
   "en": "Back down, Garrus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00522",
   "en": "Time to die, doctor!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00523",
   "en": "All right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00524",
   "en": "I'll do it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00525",
   "en": "Think, Garrus!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00526",
   "en": "I'll tell you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00527",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Garrus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00528",
   "en": "Well... I guess we're done here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00529",
   "en": "Looks like Saleon is doing more than cloning organs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00530",
   "en": "That was... satisfying.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00531",
   "en": "What was that, Shepard?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00532",
   "en": "Good. Remember that feeling. That's how it should be.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00533",
   "en": "Never hesitate when you've got the enemy in your sights, Garrus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00534",
   "en": "We're done here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG70_14_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00535",
   "en": "Move out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA60_08A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_UNC61_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00536",
   "en": "A lesson.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00537",
   "en": "What do you think?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00538",
   "en": "I will, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00539",
   "en": "Point taken.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA30_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA30_00news_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00540",
   "en": "Looks like the good doctor is up to more than cloning organs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00541",
   "en": "This doctor's got himself into some serious trouble.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00542",
   "en": "What has this doctor gotten himself into?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00543",
   "en": "What are you doing here? This is my ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00544",
   "en": "I've got work here that doesn't concern you. I'm just protecting my interests.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00545",
   "en": "We know what kind of work you do here, doctor.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00546",
   "en": "In that case, you'll also know that I'd be a fool to let you leave here with that knowledge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00547",
   "en": "Garrus won't be happy we killed this guy without him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00548",
   "en": "Garrus will be displeased when he learns we did this without him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00549",
   "en": "Garrus will be upset he wasn't here to deal with the doctor himself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00550",
   "en": "If you're too weak to hunt, you don't deserve the kill.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00551",
   "en": "I just saved your life. Show some appreciation!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00552",
   "en": "I could have just left you to your fate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00553",
   "en": "Let's move, people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00554",
   "en": "Garrus is a big boy. He'll get over it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00555",
   "en": "I think he'll understand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00556",
   "en": "It almost wasn't!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00557",
   "en": "Friendly...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00558",
   "en": "Nice to meet you too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00559",
   "en": "Exactly.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00560",
   "en": "It's not personal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00561",
   "en": "Enough chatter.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00562",
   "en": "Too bad for him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE34_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
